{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "inline-edit",
  "title": "Inline edit",
  "group": "Microinteractions",
  "order": 10,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Click a name to rename it where it is: the text becomes a field with the same font and width, Enter or leaving saves, Escape puts it back. A save draws a small check; a refused save restores the old name, shakes, and says why.",
    "id": "Klik sebuah nama untuk mengganti namanya di tempat: teks menjadi kolom dengan font dan lebar yang sama, Enter atau meninggalkan kolom menyimpan, Escape mengembalikannya. Penyimpanan menggambar centang kecil; penyimpanan yang ditolak mengembalikan nama lama, bergoyang, dan menjelaskan alasannya."
  },
  "titleId": "Inline edit",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Rename an activity",
        "desc": "Click the name, type, press Enter. The check draws in; the new name stays. Escape restores the old one.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\">\n  <span class=\"card__sub\">Activity</span>\n  <span style=\"font: var(--type-title-2); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-title-2);\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Rename activity\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">May toddler vaccination</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span>\n</div>",
        "code": "<h1><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline>\n  <button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Rename activity\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">May toddler vaccination</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button>\n</span></h1>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  document.querySelector('[data-lds-inline]').addEventListener('lds:save', (e) => {\n    e.detail.wait(api.rename(e.detail.value)); // rejection restores e.detail.previous, shakes, announces\n  });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Rename a file in a list",
        "desc": "In a row the field takes the title's place and size; the size and date beside it do not move.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 440px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Rename RW meeting minutes\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">RW meeting minutes</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">340 KB</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Rename Business location sketch\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">Business location sketch</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">1.1 MB</span></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Mengganti nama kegiatan",
        "desc": "Klik namanya, ketik, tekan Enter. Centang tergambar; nama baru tetap. Escape mengembalikan nama lama.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\">\n  <span class=\"card__sub\">Kegiatan</span>\n  <span style=\"font: var(--type-title-2); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-title-2);\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Ganti nama kegiatan\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">Vaksinasi balita Mei</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span>\n</div>",
        "code": "<h1><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline>\n  <button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Ganti nama kegiatan\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">Vaksinasi balita Mei</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button>\n</span></h1>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  document.querySelector('[data-lds-inline]').addEventListener('lds:save', (e) => {\n    e.detail.wait(api.rename(e.detail.value)); // rejection restores e.detail.previous, shakes, announces\n  });\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Mengganti nama berkas di daftar",
        "desc": "Di dalam baris, kolom mengambil tempat dan ukuran judul; ukuran berkas dan tanggal di sampingnya tidak bergeser.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 440px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Ganti nama Notulen rapat RW\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">Notulen rapat RW</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">340 KB</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"inline-edit\" data-lds-inline><button class=\"inline-edit__text\" aria-label=\"Ganti nama Denah lokasi usaha\"><span class=\"inline-edit__value\">Denah lokasi usaha</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">edit</span></button></span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">1,1 MB</span></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "text-field",
